                                "sense_id": "a5db8484-b00a-3fc5-af71-cb9a7eb0d1e5",
                                "text": "[…] contemporaneous with gold are gilbertite, leptochlorite, tourmaline, iron sulphides, feldspar, (rare) carbonates, and quartz; post gold minerals are quartz, zinc and lead sulphides, and many others of geophases K and L."
                            },
